  "Description": "This course focuses on animation and illustrative storytelling. Topics include structural elements of storytelling, storyboarding formats, motion and animation and character development. The course will take a step-by-step approach to story development, using the medium of storyboards. The creation and use of animatics will also be introduced and explored.",
  "StudentTasks": "- Attend at least 80% of contact hours in order to be accepted to the final examination\n- Actively participate in class activities\n- Fulfil tasks given by intructor after class\n- Use their own laptop in class only for learning purpose\n- Read the textbook and references in advance\n- Access the course website (https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/) for up-to-date information and material of the course.\n- Computer with sofware PS, AI, ID, Adobe After Effects installed\n- Complete course's Portfolio with full contents of exercises and submit to the teacher 1 day after the course",
  "Tools": "Tools: Learning tool requirements\n1. School preparation:\na) For each student\n- 01 light table\n\nb) To the studio:\n- Glass table\n- 01 projector\n\n2. Students preparation:\n- Pencil, eraser, ruler, A3 paper. A4\n- Computer with some version of photograph editing software such as Ps, Ai, Ae, Pr",
